Package: cmgdr
Title: Low-Level Access to curatedMetagenomicData Public Releases
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Sean", "Davis", , "seandavi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small client for the public curatedMetagenomicData (cMD) data
    releases at <https://cmgd-public.cancerdatasci.org>. Finds datasets and
    releases from their JSON indexes, lists tables, studies and HUMAnN
    gene-family files, downloads files into a verified cache, reads per-study
    files, builds species TreeSummarizedExperiment objects and attaches a
    release's read-only DuckLake catalog in DuckDB for SQL and dplyr queries.
